BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Build for What's Next: Strategies for Modernizing Your Infrastruct
 ure
DTSTART:20260930T000000
DTEND:20260930T000000
DTSTAMP:20260930T172235Z
UID:9da4624f13b940d696ac17d337dfa8@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Build for What's Next: Strategies for Modernizing Your Infrast
 ructure\, an executive discussion for IT leaders\, will examine how organi
 zations can modernize their technology infrastructure while making smarter
  decisions around networking\, virtualization\, compute and storage. The e
 vent will be hosted by technology services provider Tusker from 11 a.m. to
  1 p.m. on Wednesday\, Sept. 30 at Ruth’s Chris Steak House\, 500 Totten
  Pond Road\, Waltham\, MA. The program will be followed by a complimentary
  executive lunch and peer discussion. Led by Tusker’s Nick Stover\, Prac
 tice Director\, Modern Datacenter\; Kush Patel\, Chief Innovation Officer
 \; Steven Huynh\, Enterprise Architect and Javier Medina\, Enterprise Solu
 tions Consultant\, and moderated by Greg Marts\, Vice President of Cloud S
 olutions\, the session will explore how organizations can build an infrast
 ructure roadmap for the next 12–18 months\, prepare for evolving busines
 s demands\, navigate licensing and virtualization changes\, and improve re
 silience\, observability and operational efficiency. It will also provide 
 practical insights into prioritizing investments across networking\, compu
 te and storage\, determining which emerging technologies actually make sen
 se for an organization\, and benchmarking existing infrastructure using Tu
 sker’s Data Center Modernization Scorecard. Register to attend at Tusker
  | Build for What's Next: Strategies for Modernizing Your Infrastructure B
 oston LEARN MORE / REGISTER Sources: Meet Boston Event page: https://www.m
 eetboston.com/event/build-for-whats-next%3a-strategies-for-modernizing-you
 r-infrastructure/92766/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough
 \, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSour
 ce page: https://www.meetboston.com/event/build-for-whats-next%3a-strategi
 es-for-modernizing-your-infrastructure/92766/
LOCATION:Ruth's Chris Steak House Waltham\, Ruth's Chris Steak House Walth
 am 500 Totten Pond Road\, Waltham\, MA\, 02451
URL:https://www.meetboston.com/event/build-for-whats-next%3a-strategies-fo
 r-modernizing-your-infrastructure/92766/
END:VEVENT
