SUMMARY:The Immaculate Conception: Society of Saints Peter and Paul Theolo
 gy by the Slice
DTSTART:20260930T220000
DTEND:20260930T230000
DTSTAMP:20260930T172235Z
UID:e4e0c005e32e4d3ef9e78779c92a15@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:This Wednesday\, September 30th\, at 6 PM in the Williams Soci
 al Space\, Peter and Paul will be hosting our very own Father John Gavin\,
  SJ\, for his talk "On the Immaculate Conception\," which is the first ins
 tallment of our "Questiones et Dubia" series. "Questiones et Dubia" is foc
 used on explaining challenging parts of Catholic Church doctrine and allow
 ing us all to discuss and ask questions so as to further deepen our faith.
  This first night will be on the Catholic belief that St. Mary\, the mothe
 r of Jesus\, was born sinless. Dinner will be provided. This event will ta
 ke place in the Williams Social Space\, which is located on the first floo
 r of Williams Hall. Someone will be at the front door of Williams to direc
 t you to the room. All are welcome! --- Event Details: https://myhc.holycr
 oss.edu/rsvp?id=2154640 Source: College of the Holy Cross Event page: http
