DESCRIPTION:Join us for the grand opening of “Living the Mission: Honori
 ng the Overlooked\, Inspiring the Future\,” a new exhibit in Pierre’s 
 Pub on Thursday\, October 1 at 11:30 a.m. Two years in the making by facul
 ty\, staff\, and especially students\, this grant-funded exhibit enlivens 
 Assumption’s history by celebrating people who have embodied our mission
  since 1904 but whose contributions have often been overlooked. The galler
 y features ten figures from Assumption’s first century\, plus a digital 
 display of more recent honorees. President Weiner will offer remarks\, fol
 lowed by a celebration with the honorees and their families. Source: Assum
 ption University Event page: https://www.assumption.edu/news-and-events/ev
 ents/living-the-mission-exhibit-grand-opening\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30
