BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:South High Community School - Smile Day Celebration
DTSTART:20261002T234500
DTEND:20261003T024500
DTSTAMP:20260930T172235Z
UID:58aade17d2132a3d73a315ed949085@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:Volunteers Needed - Help spread smiles and kindness in the Wor
 cester Public School community by volunteering at South High School's Worl
 d Smile Day Celebration on Friday\, October 2nd\, from 7:45am - 10am. The 
 South High School 365Z Kindness Club will celebrate by wearing yellow and 
 taking a community walk from South High School to Gates Lane Elementary Sc
 hool. Once there\, high school students and volunteers will spend time gre
 eting elementary students and handing out stickers\, pencils\, and other s
 mall "smile" surprises before returning to South High. Volunteer Responsib
 ilities: Meet students at South High School and join the walk to Gates Lan
 e Elementary. Assist with supervising and supporting high school students 
 along the walking route. Help distribute stickers\, pencils\, and other sm
 ile-themed giveaways to elementary students at Gates Lane Elementary. Enga
 ge with students and help create a welcoming\, positive atmosphere. Why Vo
 lunteer? This is a fun opportunity to make a positive impact\, celebrate k
 indness\, and connect with local students. Volunteer support helps ensure 
 a safe and successful event while reducing the number of teachers needed t
 o be away from the classroom. Time Commitment: Approximately 2.25 hours\, 
 including the walk from South High School to Gates Lane Elementary School 
 and back to South High School\, as well as the celebration activity. Locat
 ion: South High School\,170 Apricot Street\, Worcester\, MA Come walk\, sm
 ile\, and help brighten someone's day! 🌟😊 Registration deadline: Sep
 tember 25\, 2026 Contact Noemi Robertson\, nrobertson@wpi.edu to register.
  --- Event Details: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=405503 Source: Worcester
  Polytechnic Institute Event page: https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=405503\n
 \nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: L
 ocal fallback from worcester-colleges-events.ics\nSource page: https://myw
 pi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=405503
LOCATION:South High Community School\, 170 Apricot St\, Worcester 01603\, 
 United States
URL:https://mywpi.wpi.edu/rsvp?id=405503
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Spamalot
DTSTART:20261002T000000
DTEND:20261004T000000
DTSTAMP:20260930T172235Z
UID:64101fafb18c9393c4c15e62b21683@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:The Tony Award-Winning Best Musical Comedy is BACK! Hot off a 
 critically acclaimed Broadway revival in 2023\, Monty Python’s Spamalot 
 \, the Tony Award®-winning Best Musical\, comes to Worcester. Lovingly ri
 pped off from the film classic\, Monty Python and the Holy Grail\, Spamalo
 t features a book & lyrics by Eric Idle and music by John Du Prez and Eric
  Idle. Spamalot has everything you need for a great knight at the theatre 
 – from flying cows to killer rabbits\, British royalty to French taunter
 s\, dancing girls\, rubbery shrubbery\, and of course\, the Lady of the La
 ke. Spamalot features songs that will leave you humming including “Alway
 s Look on the Bright Side of Life\,” “The Song That Goes Like This\,
 ” “Find Your Grail\,” and more that have become beloved classics in 
 musical theatre. All-In Pricing: Including all fees\, tickets range from $
 55 to $100 depending on seat location and availability. Save on handling f
 ees in person at The Hanover Theatre box office. Contact the box office at
  877.571.7469 for more information. Run Time: 2 hours and 20 minutes\, inc
 luding a 15-minute intermission Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Ev
 ent page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/spamalot/30519/\n\nEvent
 s Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fa
 llback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.discovercen
 tralma.org/event/spamalot/30519/
LOCATION:The Hanover Theatre and Conservatory for the Performing Arts\, 2 
 Southbridge St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/spamalot/30519/
END:VEVENT
