BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Blessing of the Animals
DTSTART:20261003T000000
DTEND:20261003T000000
DTSTAMP:20260930T172235Z
UID:09e3c9d5a021ed95d2f3d3709b98de@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:The First Congregational Church of Shrewsbury will be hosting 
 its 4th Annual Blessing of the Animals event on Saturday\, October 3\, 202
 6 from 12:00 pm - 3:00 pm on the Shrewsbury Town Common. This event is fre
 e and open to the public. All well-behaved pets are invited to bring their
  people. A blessing ceremony will take place promptly at noon\, followed b
 y all community pets being individually blessed by Pastor Holly MillerShan
 k. Photo and stuffed animal pet representations are welcome. Each blessed 
 pet will receive a special blessing tag. Also in attendance will be our sp
 ecial rescue guests\, the Worcester Animal Rescue League\, Handsome Dan’
 s Rescue and Buddy Dog who will be sharing information about their rescues
 \, services and adoption opportunities. This year\, attendees are encourag
 ed to bring a pet food donation to benefit the Central Mass Pet Pantry in 
 Shrewsbury\, which will also be in attendance. CMPP’s mission is to prov
 ide pet food and supplies to individuals and families in Central Massachus
 etts who are struggling to afford them\, ensuring that pets can remain wit
 h their owners and don’t have to be surrendered due to financial hardshi
 p. The church is also sponsoring FREE pony rides provided by Ridge Valley 
 Stables from 12:30-2:30 pm. Uhlman’s Ice Cream Truck will be on hand wit
 h treats for sale and Chiampa Funeral Home will offer information about pe
 t cremation services. For a $5 donation participants may paint and take ho
 me a pet rock. In the event of rain\, an abbreviated version of this event
  that will include a blessing service only will be held on Saturday\, Octo
 ber 10\, 2026 at 12:00 pm. Sources: Discover Central Massachusetts Event p
 age: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/blessing-of-the-animals/30739
 /\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery
 : Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: https://www.d
 iscovercentralma.org/event/blessing-of-the-animals/30739/
LOCATION:Shrewsbury Town Common\, 19 Church Road\, Shrewsbury\, MA\, 01545
URL:https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/blessing-of-the-animals/30739/
END:VEVENT
