DESCRIPTION:This modern healing gathering is designed to help you connect 
 more deeply with yourself\, release old patterns\, and nourish your inner 
 landscape. Cacao is a sacred plant medicine\, and one of the only foods kn
 own to harmonize both hemispheres of the brain. It is considered by the Ma
 yans as a tool for emotional and energetic transformation. During our time
  together\, we will engage in somatic movement\, gentle meditation\, cacao
  tasting\, and a guided visualization to reconnect with your heart’s des
 ires. You’ll leave feeling grounded\, uplifted\, and more in tune with y
 our intuitive self. Gathering over refreshments afterwards. Sources: Disco
 ver Central Massachusetts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/ev
 ent/cacao-circle%3a-a-meditative-gathering-with-veronica/30966/\n\nEvents 
