BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:The Buena Vista Orchestra
DTSTART:20261006T000000
DTEND:20261006T000000
DTSTAMP:20260930T172235Z
UID:3c700ca171013f75e2ec9ab1879e4c@events-near-me
DESCRIPTION:The Buena Vista Orchestra is one of the world’s premier Cuba
 n music repertory ensembles\, featuring a rotating lineup of acclaimed mus
 icians connected to legendary groups and artists such as Buena Vista Socia
 l Club\, AfroCuban All Stars\, Celia Cruz\, Omara Portuondo\, Chucho Vald
 és and Willie Colón. On their 2025 U.S. tour\, the orchestra is led by a
 cclaimed Cuban violinist Rolando Morejón Reyes\, performing a vibrant pro
 gram that celebrates the rich legacy of Cuban music. Featuring world-class
  performers from iconic ensembles and historic Havana performances\, the s
 how brings the rhythms\, melodies and spirit of this globally celebrated m
 usical tradition to the stage. Building on the legacy of the Buena Vista m
 ovement\, one of the most successful and influential Cuban music projects 
 in history\, The Buena Vista Orchestra continues to share this timeless so
 und with audiences around the world. Sources: Discover Central Massachuset
 ts Event page: https://www.discovercentralma.org/event/the-buena-vista-orc
 hestra/29751/\n\nEvents Near Me: within 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 0153
 2\nDiscovery: Local fallback from massachusetts-events.ics\nSource page: h
 ttps://www.discovercentralma.org/event/the-buena-vista-orchestra/29751/
LOCATION:The Hanover Theatre and Conservatory for the Performing Arts\, 2 
 Southbridge St.\, Worcester\, MA\, 01608
