DESCRIPTION:The Assumption University Band will perform its annual Hallowe
 en concert on Thursday\, October 8\, 2026\, under the direction of its con
 ductor\, Bruce Hopkins. The performance will be at 8:00 p.m. in the Curtis
  Performance Hall\, Tsotsis Center\, Assumption University\, 500 Salisbury
  Street\, Worcester\, MA. Featured will be works by Robert Sheldon\, Steve
 n Pyter\, Gene Milford\, Rob Grice\, Steven Reineke\, and Mark Williams. A
 delaide Greenwald ’28 will also play Concerto de Aranjuez by Rodrigo for
  flugelhorn and band. Additionally\, flutist Mia Biancamano ’28 will be 
 featured in a performance of the Theme from Schindler’s List by John Wil
 liams. The concert is open to the public and is free of charge. Source: As
 sumption University Event page: https://www.assumption.edu/news-and-events
 /events/assumption-university-band-halloween-concert\n\nEvents Near Me: wi
 thin 30 miles of Northborough\, MA 01532\nDiscovery: Local fallback from w
