DESCRIPTION:Do you like to read but struggle to find the time? Join the Li
 brary Book Club for a "Silent-ish Book Club!" This is dedicated time to br
 ing something you're currently reading for fun and enjoy quiet reading in 
 community with others\, with the option to chat a little about what you're
  reading. All reading formats and genres are welcome (though we request if
  you are listening to an audiobook\, please bring headphones). This event 
